.TH mnnn-report-edit-section 1  "mnnn-report-edit-section 2.9.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-report\-edit\-section \- Change a section\*(Aqs title, text, format or rows
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn report edit\-section\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-text\fR] [\fB\-\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-rows\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPORT\fR> <\fISECTION\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change a section\*(Aqs title, text, format or rows
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-text\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
The text
.TP
\fB\-\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Read the text from a file (`\-`: stdin)
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
markdown
.IP \(bu 2
latex
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-rows\fR \fI<ROWS>\fR
Bars listed by a records section (0: all)
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPORT\fR>

.TP
<\fISECTION\fR>
Section number (from `mnnn report show`) or id
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.9.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
